flowchart TB
    %% Inputs
    A[Seed Inputs<br/>IOC / Alert / Hunt Query / Anomaly] --> B[Alpha Dispatcher<br/>Task routing + light arbitration]

    %% Shared services
    B <--> C[Shared Case Memory<br/>Case state / hypotheses / pivots / confidence]
    B <--> D[Event Bus<br/>Tasks / findings / branch updates / status]
    B <--> E[Policy Guardrails<br/>Approval rules / execution boundaries]
    B <--> F[Evidence Ledger<br/>Immutable timeline / replay trail]

    %% V1 Pack
    D --> G[Tracker Agent<br/>Find initial credible scent]
    D --> H[Flanker Agent<br/>Expand sideways + elevate fresh branch]
    D --> J[Closer Agent<br/>Assemble verdict + next-best action]
    D --> K[Scribe Agent<br/>Logging only]

    %% Shared memory + evidence interactions
    G <--> C
    H <--> C
    J <--> C
    K --> C

    G --> D
    H --> D
    J --> D
    K --> D

    G --> F
    H --> F
    J --> F
    K --> F

    %% Data/tool sources
    L[Telemetry Sources<br/>SIEM / EDR / IAM / DNS / Email / Cloud Logs] --> G
    L --> H

    M[Threat Intel + Knowledge<br/>ATT&amp;CK / CVEs / IOC feeds / Asset context] --> G
    M --> H
    M --> J

    %% Human decision path
    J --> N[Analyst Review]
    E --> N
    N --> O{Approve learning update?}

    O -- Yes --> R[Learning Queue<br/>Approved dead ends / similar cases / playbook updates]
    O -- No --> S[No memory update]

    %% End states
    N --> T{Case outcome}
    T -- Escalate --> U[Escalation / Ticket / Case handoff]
    T -- Benign --> V[Close benign]
    T -- Continue hunt --> W[New tasks back to dispatcher]

    W --> B
    R --> C

    %% V1.5 extensions
    X[Blocker Agent - V1.5<br/>Predict escape paths + recommend containment]:::future
    D -. future tasking .-> X
    X -. future findings .-> D
    X -. future evidence .-> F

    Y[Post-Hunt Analyst Agent - V1.5<br/>Generate summaries / ATT&amp;CK mapping / lessons learned]:::future
    N -. analyst-approved post-hunt analysis .-> Y
    F -. evidence source .-> Y
    C -. case context .-> Y
    Y -. summary artifacts .-> Z[Post-Hunt Report / ATT&amp;CK Map / Lessons Learned]:::future

    %% Classes
    classDef input fill:#E8F1FB,stroke:#2F6B9A,color:#0F2740,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef control fill:#EDE9FE,stroke:#6D28D9,color:#2B145A,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef memory fill:#ECFDF5,stroke:#0F766E,color:#073B3A,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef agent fill:#FFF7ED,stroke:#C2410C,color:#431407,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef review fill:#FEF3C7,stroke:#B45309,color:#4A2C00,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef outcome fill:#F3F4F6,stroke:#4B5563,color:#111827,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef future fill:#FCE7F3,stroke:#BE185D,color:#500724,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray: 6 4;

    class A,L,M input;
    class B,D,E control;
    class C,F,R,S memory;
    class G,H,J,K agent;
    class N,O review;
    class T,U,V,W outcome;
    class X,Y,Z future;
